@startuml
title FR-13 - Record Eligibility Decision - Activity Diagram
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Donor Screener|
start
:Open the attempt from the screening queue\nor by scanning the ticket;

|Server — Donations|
:Retrieve the attempt and\nits linked donor reference;

|Client|
:Display the attempt;

|Donor Screener|
:Confirm that the attempt belongs\nto the correct donor;
:Review the predonation assessment;

if (Selected decision?) then (Eligible)
  :Record "Eligible" and the screening details;
else (Deferred)
  :Record "Deferred", the screening details,\nand a deferral reason;
endif

:Click the save button;

|Server — Donations|
:Check the current attempt state,\nrequired information, and the deferral reason\nwhen the decision is "Deferred";

if (Decision complete and\nattempt state permits it?) then (Yes)

  if (Decision is Eligible?) then (Yes)
    :Save the "Eligible" decision\nand screening details;
    :Move the attempt to the collection queue;

    |Client|
    :Display the recorded decision\nand the new collection queue status;
    stop

  else (Deferred)
    |Server — Donations|
    :Save the "Deferred" decision,\nscreening details, and reason;
    :Close the attempt;

    |Client|
    :Display the recorded decision\nand closed attempt status;
    stop
  endif

else (No)
  |Server — Donations|
  :Reject the decision;

  |Client|
  :Explain the rejection reason;
  stop
endif

@enduml